    <string name="about_team_generator">About Team Selector</string>
    <string name="team_generator_purpose">• What it\'s for: Randomly and interactively divides participants into teams using multi-touch.</string>
    <string name="team_help_guide">• Quick guide:</string>
    <string name="team_generator_help_1">   – Choose between \"Team count\" or \"Team size\".</string>
    <string name="team_generator_help_2">   – Each player places one finger on the screen (supports up to 10 fingers).</string>
    <string name="team_generator_help_3">   – Uneven teams are supported when numbers don\'t divide evenly (e.g. 8 players in teams of 3 will form 2 teams of 3 and 1 of 2).</string>
    <string name="team_generator_help_4">   – Hold your fingers still for 1 second until the rings fill up. Results stay frozen. To restart, triple-tap the screen (even with fingers still held) or tap \"New draw\".</string>
